:: Carter House Do Homework Basic [nobr]

/* Intro */
<<set $Minutes += 30>>
As you and <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> are relaxing on his beanbags, you suddenly remember that you haven’t done your homework yet. Thankfully, it is in the bag brought with you and you reach over and pull it out. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> <span style="color:Yellow">raises an eyebrow at this in confusion before realizing what it is and sighing loudly, sinking into his beanbag further.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Homework!?”</span> He says like it’s a bad word, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“You’re not going to sit here and do homework, are you? That’s dumb…”</span> <br>

    <<set _ad to [
        {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
            },
        },
        {
            Name: "Carter",
            State: {
                Outfit: "Everyday",
                Mouth: "Frown",
                Eyes: "Tired",
            },
        },
    ]>>
    <<ad _ad>>

You laugh, saying that you’ll both have to do it eventually. You’d guess he hasn’t done it yet either, so maybe it would be fun for the two of you to do it together. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Uhhhh…”</span> He groans, somehow sinking further, <span style="color:Pink">his shirt now riding up to reveal his cute belly,</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Fine~!”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> slinks over to his own backpack and grabs his homework. He seems a bit annoyed to be forced to do homework during playtime with his friend, but he does eventually admit it is better than doing it by himself. <br>
<br>
The two of you spend the next 20 or so minutes doing your homework together, though you have to take the lead on most of it since <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Carter</span> easily gets confused and has trouble focusing, often trying to start a game or rambling about something or other. <span style="color:Pink">It is rather cute, but you keep him on track enough to get your homework done.</span> <br>
<<set $Homework to 2>>
<<set $MathGrade +=1>>
<<set $HistoryGrade +=1>>
<<set $ScienceGrade +=1>>
<<set $EnglishGrade +=1>>
<<needChange "Fun" -15>>
<span style="color:Red">-Carter Fun</span><br>
<<set $HangOutNeed.Fun -= 10>>
<<socialChange "Carter" 1>>
